                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Dr. Spacezoo is a challenging but fun indie twin stick shooter with good retro pixel graphics and catchy music. It starts slow as you must learn to resist your ingrained instinct to blow everything up but picks up steam and complexity pretty quickly. The bosses are fun and take different weapons and tactics to overcome. \n\nRecommended for fans of retro twin stick shooter games, even more fun and chaotic with local co-op.",
